  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "0.5 cup butter, melted",
    "1.5 cups brown sugar",
    "24 maraschino cherries",
    "1 (20 ounce) can crushed pineapple",
    "1 (18.25 ounce) package pineapple cake mix (such as Duncan Hines® Pineapple Supreme)",
    "1.3333333730698 cups pineapple juice",
    "0.33333334326744 cup vegetable oil",
    "3 eggs",
    "1 tablespoon confectioners' sugar for dusting, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5vun3n6L8GFrFeY0Mi2FlI7MiVk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-Step-01-b0f3567498e047ce89f0ac2c359b7c02.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220808/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Move an oven rack to the middle of the oven. Spray 24 muffin cups with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LXMj8Mpzc87BGa12HxgN6b1LIUg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-Step-02-abbddc169d1b45ba98c10f51734786e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220808/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon 1 teaspoon melted butter into the bottom of each sprayed muffin cup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_i9YcP_OpeYWIKPhVd28SE1Yb3U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-Step-03-4d1ef033e86e4d5186b7f724d0ac8ceb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220808/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon 1 tablespoon brown sugar into each muffin cup. Press a maraschino cherry into the center of the brown sugar in each muffin cup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wzPNxqFc58Tdv3FpvczXZbwJ6Qg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-Step-05-68c6768a56024c3cb8fa7e9d424e2c28.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220808/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon a heaping tablespoon of crushed pineapple on top and compact it with the back of a spoon into an even layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2W8ts66fYioT1Ia-kwHtT2VUB58=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-Step-06-128438d7b2404b15b2d47b1d0535cec1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220808/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix pineapple cake mix, pineapple juice, vegetable oil, and eggs in a large bowl with an electric mixer on low speed until moistened, about 30 seconds. Increase speed to medium; mix for 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1Ozbh1dmxQ5Tm6wfqLLUXXzvYYg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-Step-07-555a361c24dc4fec89509fcd3a6da369.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220808/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour batter into the muffin cups, filling them to the top; do not overfill.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y4tsWj5s8bjEui71ZSXrqXKf8KY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-Step-08-ac7cae79aa134ea19f2105827e0f21a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220808/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of a cupcake comes out clean, about 20 minutes. Line a work surface with waxed paper. Allow cupcakes to cool at least 5 minutes before inverting muffin cups onto the waxed paper; serve with pineapple and cherry sides up.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VJqmsqbNG5ngi3NG1myxv4qGiSw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-Step-09-d958270d4b1a49a89ef69994223a11a1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220808/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle cupcakes lightly with confectioners' sugar before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/g44pX5Uyp1T5LFjFeCVeNt3Oy2s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-220808-PineappleUpsideDownCupcakes-beauty-4x3-0f8fe2ce7f6849538da7a6ed0df6e4e2.jpg"
      ],
